			},
			"date": "2025-03-10T15:54:43.217Z",
			"content": "<p>Consider `accent-color` (Not Baseline) vs. CSS Nesting (Baseline 2023).</p>\n<p>Browser compatibility is only a small piece: it’s more important to consider the role it plays and how progressive-enhancement friendly it is.</p>\n<p>CSS Nesting requires cross-browser ubiquity: `accent-color` is much safer!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xf7krjtyhvmoqjyl4dgiafey/app.bsky.feed.post/3ljzwf2ghu22g",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3ljzvytozis2q",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mdh2.bsky.social/post/3ljzwf2ghu22g",
			"private": true,
			"date": "2025-03-10T16:01:32.930Z",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
