			},
			"date": "2025-03-10T16:08:02.537Z",
			"content": "<p>I might suggest modifications to the “Limited availability” and “Newly available” tags to include language about whether a feature is progressive enhancement friendly or not!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
