			"date": "2025-03-11T09:30:05.875Z",
			"content": "<p>At Clearleft, we use Baseline as a very handy starting point for our browser support policy:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://browsersupport.clearleft.com/\">browsersupport.clearleft.com</a></p>",
