			"content": "<p>Some additional discussion is happening on this GitHub Issue: <a href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/2758\">github.com/web-platform...</a></p>\n<p>Thanks <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:vcrxgrk7qttaunjut34oe5oq\">@patrickbrosset.com</a> for filing!</p>",
